   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Real_to_Reel_%28Tesla_album%29",
   "resumo_en": "Real to Reel is the sixth studio album by hard rock band Tesla. Released on June 5, 2007, it includes covers of classic rock songs from the late 1960s and early 1970s recorded by Tesla in their own style using analog tape and vintage equipment.[1]\nBest Buy included a limited, exclusive Bonus CD with the purchase of \"Real to Reel\". This Bonus CD includes 4 songs, \"War Pigs\" from Reel Two, and unplugged versions of \"Shine Away\", \"Modern Day Cowboy\" and \"Paradise\".[2]\nAdditional 12 tracks recorded during the Real to Reel sessions, were released on a second volume, entitled Real to Reel, Vol. 2.",
